偉人 源心陣営に檄す / A Proclamation to the Genshin Camp
Bilingual (日本語 / English) code representation.

License: CC0 1.0 Universal

This module holds
  1. the proclamation as bilingual data (single source of truth)
  2. its teachings as small, testable rules:
       - AI is a navigator; thought is its compass          (AIRole)
       - thought alone vanishes, technology alone runs wild (assess_balance)
       - thought must never bind anyone; if it does, Genshin
